  "limits": [
    "Recovery requires an already persisted cleanup failure. Process death before any diagnostic is saved still uses the existing worker recovery mechanism.",
    "Environment confirmation records a user decision, not independent proof of process exit. Historical PIDs are never signalled automatically.",
    "Unresolved effects retain manual-review status. Missing external effects are not recreated, even after a second interruption during readback.",
    "Frozen deadlines, budgets, current read permissions and cancellation still apply. Original model errors remain in cleanup metadata.",
    "The business adapter is a simulator; lease, checkpoint, readback and dispatch logic are real runtime code.",
    "No version bump, publication or repeated fresh installation."
  ]
